\par\par \b \uc2  Emerging Asia  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2 -Recover a bit, wary after bombing. \b0\par\par\uc2 759 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 August 2003\par 06:07\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     By Vidya Ranganathan\par     SINGAPORE, Aug 6 (Reuters) - The Indonesian rupiah's\par weakness after the bombing of a Jakarta hotel undermined Asian\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  on Wednesday, preventing them from benefitting from\par the U.S. dollar's decline.\par     The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  pared part of their falls after the bombing\par at Jakarta's JW Marriott Hotel which claimed 16 lives on\par Tuesday.\par     But the risk of further attacks, the fear that foreign\par investment into the region will ebb and the inconsistency in\par economic indicators stopped markets from buying back Asian\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par     "This increases the risk premium in the near term, so in\par the next week or two the bias is certainly for weakening (of\par Asian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 )," said Claudio Piron, \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  strategist\par with Standard Chartered Bank.\par  \par     "In a way, they (central banks) were \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervening\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  already to\par weaken the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  and this makes it all the more potent."\par     The rupiah        inched closer to a two-week low of 8,725\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  in morning deals and then recovered. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it \par \par \uc2  would try to limit the impact of the bombing on the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , a \par \par \uc2  sign it was ready to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to limit any sharp fall. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Singapore\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  dollar        was sold heavily, but stopped\par short of Tuesday's three-month lows around 1.7668.\par     Analysts said this bout of selling would persist for a\par short while, with the uncertainty in U.S. markets about\par economic recovery providing additional reason for nervousness.\par     "While we continue to look for a medium term appreciation\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par in Asian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , a near term stalling of equity inflows\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par could see the market building small long U.S. dollar/Asia\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par positions as short term tactical trades," UBS said in a note to\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par clients.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par This weakness would suit some of the Asian central banks,\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par such as those in Korea and Taiwan, that have been \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervening\f28 \b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par heavily to contain gains in their \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , analysts said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The bombing also highlighted the vulnerability of the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Philippine peso , which has been under attack after a\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par failed mutiny on July 27 and the subsequent risks of political\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par instability.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     The peso, which the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  is believed to have\par defended from the key 55 level, was range-bound on Wednesday.\par     TOLERATING WEAKNESS\par     Deutsche Bank economist Sanjeev Sanyal said in a note the\par bombing had occurred at a time when Indonesia had stabilised\par its economy and was planning to exit a IMF loan programme.\par     The country would need to accumulate reserves aggressively\par and hence would have to keep interest rates high and stop the\par rupiah from appreciating, he said.\par     Even elsewhere, central banks in the region would tolerate\par some decline in their \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  after being glutted by foreign\par investment inflows in recent months, analysts said.\par     "Definitely Singapore is one candidate that would not be\par averse to further Sing dollar weakening, so long as it remains\par within their policy band," Piron said.\par     Even Korea managed to push up the sensitive yen-won cross\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par rate , a measure of its competitiveness against\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Japan, to 9.9 won per yen from 9.78 a week ago, he said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Meanwhile, the risk that U.S. asset markets could price in\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par similar attacks to the Indonesian bombing remained, and that\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par could upset the U.S. dollar.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "We would have to watch whether the U.S. follows by raising\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par their national threat level to orange. Then that may again put\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par pressure on the equity market in the U.S. and the dollar,"\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Piron said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "But, the benefactors there may likely be the Swiss franc\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par and euro rather than Asian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 ."\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 CURRENCIES\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  VS U.S. DOLLAR AT 0325 GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Change on the day\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2     Latest bid   Previous day    Pct Move\par  Japan yen     119.85       120.44  