\par\par \b \uc2  Emerging Asia  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2 -Rupiah falls sharply to 11-week low. \b0\par\par\uc2 734 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 Juli 2003\par 05:22\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     By Vidya Ranganathan\par     SINGAPORE, July 23 (Reuters) - The Indonesian rupiah lost\par almost two percent on Wednesday as it fell to 11-week lows,\par with suspected \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  unable to counter the\par pressure from foreign investors withdrawing their funds.\par     The mood was apprehensive even in the rest of Asia as\par traders watched funds move out of high-yielding \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  into\par growth plays, as a result of which the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  of leveraged\par economies such as Singapore and Taiwan found support.\par     Additionally, local factors held sway after authorities in\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Singapore intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to calm a runaway rise in bond yields and\par Korean policymakers tried to talk down the won.\par     "Confidence in global reflation is beginning to jeopardise\par capital flows into the high-yielding markets, as previously\par popular global carry trades are coming unstuck," said James\par Malcolm of JP Morgan in a note to clients.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The rupiah        fell to 8,640 in morning deals, its\par lowest low since May 5, on Wednesday -- the second anniversary\par of Megawati Sukarnoputri's taking over as Indonesia's\par President.\par     The rupiah's slide had probably been triggered by the news\par that BP Plc (BP.L) and global mining giant Rio Tinto\par  (RIO.L) (RIO.AX) were selling their stake in Indonesia's PT\par Kaltim Prima Coal to a local firm, traders said\par  \par     "Some of the hot money that entered Indonesia is getting\par out," said Bhanu Baweja, \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  strategist with UBS.\par     "And the BP deal highlights the problems in Aceh, and the\par difficulty Indonesia is likely to have in attracting foreign\par investment," he said.\par     With interest rates falling rapidly and investors flocking\par to the more technology-dominated stock markets in the region,\par foreign investment was bound to leave Indonesia, he said.\par     JP Morgan's Malcolm said Jakarta's markets had been\par complacent about the local risks of political stability and\par success in sales of bad loans during the past 18 months.\par     Slowing growth, the possibility reforms will be put on the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par backburner heading into parliamentary elections in 2004, and\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par the uncertainty over financing as the country opts out of a IMF\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par loan programme could all weigh on the rupiah, he said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Meanwhile, a Indonesian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  official said the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par market could determine the rupiah's level and there was no need\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par to \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  continuously - although traders said they thought\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Bank Indonesia had been active on both Tuesday and Wednesday.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par PESO WEAKENS\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Elsewhere, a top finance ministry official in Korea said\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par the won's             strength was not justified, given\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par the weak economy.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     The Philippine peso        was initially steady, but\par slipped in later trades to 53.95, a four-month low.\par     The rest of the regionals were stuck in ranges, like the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Japanese yen which barely reacted to reports of the deaths of\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par former Iraqi leader Sadddam Hussein's sons and the resultant\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par bullishness on the U.S. dollar.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The Sing dollar  moved in a 1.7560-1.7590 band, and\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par some traders said market nerves had calmed after suspected bond\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par purchases by the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Monetary Authority\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  of Singapore on Tuesday, to\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par contain the volatility that pushed 10-year yields to a\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par nine-month high of 3.45 percent.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The Taiwan dollar  was steady, but poised to rally\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par when the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  was prepared to let it appreciate,\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Malcolm said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "The US dollar/Taiwan dollar has one of the highest\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par correlations to global growth of all the U.S. dollar crosses we\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par track globally, so we expect the Taiwan dollar to benefit\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par disproportionately in a recovery scenario," Malcolm said in a\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par note.\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 CURRENCIES\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  VS U.S. DOLLAR AT 0255 GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Change on the day\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2     Latest bid   Previous day    Pct Move\par  Japan yen     118.96       119.02         +0.05\par  Sing dlr      1.7571       1.7581         +0.06\par  Taiwan dlr    34.430       34.440         +0.03\par  Korean won   1182.10      1182.80         +0.06\par  Baht           41.78        41.82         +0.10\par  Peso           53.95        53.85         -0.19\par  Rupiah       8550.00      8400.00         -1.75\par  Change on year\par  \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2       Latest     End prev yr     Pct Move\par  Japan yen     118.96       118.74         -0.18\par  Sing dlr      1.7571       1.7341         -1.31\par  Taiwan dlr    34.430       34.753         +0.94\par  Korean won   1182.10      1185.80         +0.31\par  Baht           41.78        43.08         +3.11\par  Peso           53.95        53.38         -1.06\par  Rupiah       8550.00      8940.00         +4.56.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020030723dz7n006y3\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
