\par\par \b \uc2  Sing dlr, baht rise on yen gains, worries linger. \b0\par\par\uc2 242 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 April 2003\par 02:48\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     0040 GMT - The Singapore dollar        edges slightly\par higher, following the U.S. dollar's decline against the yen\par   and euro       .\par     - Singapore dollar rises to around 1.7775 per U.S. dollar,\par from a one-week low of 1.7801 hit late Thursday.\par     - Dealers say given the consensus that the Sing dollar was\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  already trading below the weaker end of an undeclared policy \par \par \uc2  band of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the U.S. dollar weakness prompted \par \par \uc2  players to square out of their long U.S. dollar positions. \par \par \uc2  - "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has in the past said that it does allow \par \par \uc2  the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to trade beyond its policy band for sometime \par \par \uc2  before it decides to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said a dealer at a U.S. bank \par \par \uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  - Most analysts believe the weaker end of the policy band, \par \par \uc2  used by the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Singapore to manage its \par \par \uc2  monetary policy, was around 1.7780. \par \par \uc2  - However, a lack of confidence on the yen's strength and \par \par \uc2  worries about the economic impact of the Severe Acute \par \par \uc2  Respiratory Syndrome is likely to keep U.S. dollar demand \par \par \uc2  intact at dips. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     - Thai baht        little moved from recent range around\par the 42.80 per dollar level in early offshore trade.\par     - Dealers in Singapore say baht likely to take cue from\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par moves in yen and Sing dollar and could edge slightly higher to\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par around the 42.70 level before fresh dollar demand from\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par importers kicks in.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020030425dz4p001e8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
